; Table of the five sprite drawers
;
; Words indexed by the sprite width in bytes minus 1; #R$99C9 jumps through it. Each drawer draws one character row of
; the sprite (up to 8 pixel rows) as four calls of its strip routine.
; .
; +0 word: #R$9A02, 1 byte wide
; +2 word: #R$9A36, 2 bytes wide
; +4 word: #R$9A7C, 3 bytes wide
; +6 word: #R$9AD4, 4 bytes wide
; +8 word: #R$9B3E, 5 bytes wide
@label=SpriteDrawerTable
w$99E8 DEFW $9A02    ; width 1
 $99EA DEFW $9A36    ; width 2
 $99EC DEFW $9A7C    ; width 3
 $99EE DEFW $9AD4    ; width 4
 $99F0 DEFW $9B3E    ; width 5
